{"id":"421706","name":"咖喱豆腐汤","author":"尔东叶","authorId":"6100832","desc":"","cover":"images/421706/cover.jpg","ingredients":{"main":[{"name":"豆腐","amount":"150g"}],"sub":[{"name":"咖喱粉","amount":"适量"},{"name":"盐","amount":"适量"},{"name":"香菜","amount":"适量"},{"name":"胡萝卜","amount":"适量"},{"name":"木耳","amount":"适量"},{"name":"淀粉","amount":"适量"}]},"steps":[{"step":1,"desc":"木耳提前泡发用水焯后，撕成小朵。","img":"images/421706/step_1.jpg"},{"step":2,"desc":"豆腐切成块。","img":"images/421706/step_2.jpg"},{"step":3,"desc":"香菜、胡萝卜洗干净切碎。","img":"images/421706/step_3.jpg"},{"step":4,"desc":"煮锅加水，豆腐入锅煮。","img":"images/421706/step_4.jpg"},{"step":5,"desc":"开锅2分钟后，加咖喱粉。","img":"images/421706/step_5.jpg"},{"step":6,"desc":"搅拌均匀，开锅后胡萝卜入锅。","img":"images/421706/step_6.jpg"},{"step":7,"desc":"开锅后木耳入锅。","img":"images/421706/step_7.jpg"},{"step":8,"desc":"再开锅后加适量盐。","img":"images/421706/step_8.jpg"},{"step":9,"desc":"淋入芡汁。","img":"images/421706/step_9.jpg"},{"step":10,"desc":"后关火，撒些香菜碎。","img":"images/421706/step_10.jpg"},{"step":11,"desc":"搅拌均匀即可盛出享用。","img":"images/421706/step_11.jpg"}],"tips":"1、咖喱粉很有味道，加盐时要适量。\n2、勾芡与否随个人习惯。\n3、木耳要提前用水焯。\n\n \n\t\t\t\t\n\t\t\t\t\t来自 美食天下  的作品\n\t\t\t\t\n\t\t\t\t\t使用的厨具：煮锅\n\t\t\t\t\n\t\t\t\t\t所属分类：","attrs":{}}